{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras/d7b504611cf455c4b150f7e65cc7e2cf.avif?t=1762003416\" alt=\"Build\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras_big/d7b504611cf455c4b150f7e65cc7e2cf.webp?t=1762003416 width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your city block by block. Place, pack and merge buildings onto the grid to grow your economy and defense. Expand your city's borders above and below the ground to increase your damage and resources gained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras/fa326fecb5a61b334cc22b9df4601d3b.poster.avif?t=1762003416\" aria-label=\"a short video showcasing the building mechanics of the game. The player is placing and merging buildings and turrets onto a grid.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras/fa326fecb5a61b334cc22b9df4601d3b.webm?t=1762003416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras/fa326fecb5a61b334cc22b9df4601d3b.mp4?t=1762003416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras/559ca2987bb4fe604b23583054d2393f.avif?t=1762003416\" alt=\"Defend\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras_big/559ca2987bb4fe604b23583054d2393f.webp?t=1762003416 width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your defenses cut down waves of enemies and turn the tides of combat with the commander's powerful ability. Combine turrets with various effects to maximize your city's defensive capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras/7480d60260b53e72031be0961549b58d.poster.avif?t=1762003416\" aria-label=\"a short video showcasing the combat of the game. Turrets are firing as enemies are approaching from all sides\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras/7480d60260b53e72031be0961549b58d.webm?t=1762003416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras/7480d60260b53e72031be0961549b58d.mp4?t=1762003416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras/372c2948a799d13f16e79184ad72ab0d.avif?t=1762003416\" alt=\"Persist\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras_big/372c2948a799d13f16e79184ad72ab0d.webp?t=1762003416 width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way to play by combining different buildings into your own unique strategy. Face growing hordes of enemies and take down their boss to claim a piece of the wasteland for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755200/extras/b405ebecd31e3cfb4b5126a2e54fbb84.poster.avif?t=1762003416\" width=1170 height=658 >